window.AUDIO={"Good morning. How are you?": "", "How are you today?": "", "I'm fine, thanks. And you?": "", "What do you do?": "", "I'm an engineer.": "", "Where do you work?": "", "I work at the Cyclotron Center.": "", "What time does the run start?": "", "The run starts at 5 a.m.": "", "Is the batch ready?": "", "Yes, batch 42 is ready.": "", "Did you send the report?": "", "Yes, I sent it this morning.": "", "Are you busy now?": "", "Yes, I'm busy. Can we talk later?": "", "Can you help me?": "", "Sure. What do you need?": "", "Where is the RSO?": "", "He is in the hot lab.": "", "When is the delivery?": "", "The courier arrives at 8.": "", "How many doses did the hospital order?": "", "Three doses.": "", "What is the activity?": "", "The activity is 500 MBq.": "", "Is QC finished?": "", "Yes, QC is finished.": "", "Can I speak to the manager?": "", "He is not here now. Can I take a message?": "", "What's the problem?": "", "The printer doesn't work.": "", "Can we meet at 2?": "", "Yes, 2 is OK.": "", "When is the audit?": "", "The audit is next week.": "", "Did you sign the logbook?": "", "Yes, I signed it.": "", "What did you do today?": "", "I checked emails and sent the orders.": "", "How was your weekend?": "", "It was good. I stayed home.": "", "Is there anything else?": "", "No, that's all. Thank you.": "", "Good morning.": "", "How are you?": "", "I'm fine, thanks.": "", "See you later.": "", "Have a good day.": "", "My name is Nam.": "", "We have a 30 MeV cyclotron.": "", "I help with orders and reports.": "", "It's 8 o'clock.": "", "Batch number 42.": "", "The half-life is 110 minutes.": "", "Today is Monday.": "", "Maintenance is on Friday.": "", "I work from 8 to 5.": "", "I'm off on Sunday.": "", "Sorry?": "", "Can you say that again?": "", "Slower, please.": "", "What does release mean?": "", "I understand now.": "", "This is the office.": "", "The hot lab is downstairs.": "", "The clean room is there.": "", "Don't enter now.": "", "I have a question.": "", "How do I do this?": "", "Please show me.": "", "Thank you so much.": "", "Can I leave early today?": "", "Can I take a day off on Friday?": "", "May I use this room?": "", "Is it OK if I come at 9?": "", "Sorry, I'm late.": "", "I sent the report.": "", "The order is done.": "", "QC is finished.": "", "Batch 42 is released.": "", "I finished at 3 p.m.": "", "I'm busy now.": "", "Can we talk later?": "", "I'm free after lunch.": "", "Give me five minutes.": "", "Yes, now is fine.": "", "Hello, this is Nam from the plant.": "", "Can I speak to Mr. Lee?": "", "He is not here now.": "", "Can I take a message?": "", "I'll call back later.": "", "Please see the file attached.": "", "The invoice is attached.": "", "Can you confirm?": "", "Thank you for your email.": "", "Best regards.": "", "The night shift starts at 10.": "", "The run went well.": "", "Two batches are ready.": "", "One order is pending.": "", "Please sign the logbook.": "", "There is a problem.": "", "The cyclotron stopped at 6.": "", "The courier is late.": "", "I will call maintenance.": "", "Tuesday is OK for me.": "", "Can we move it to Thursday?": "", "Sorry, I have to cancel.": "", "Let's meet next week.": "", "The hospital ordered three doses.": "", "The delivery is on time.": "", "Please check the release certificate.": "", "Wear your dosimeter badge.": "", "Don't enter the hot lab now.": "", "Wait for it to decay.": "", "Check for contamination.": "", "Call the RSO, please.": "", "It's hot today.": "", "What do you want for lunch?": "", "I like coffee.": "", "See you after lunch.": "", "I start at 8.": "", "First I check emails.": "", "Then I send the orders.": "", "The run finishes at 7.": "", "I go home at 5.": "", "Please sign here.": "", "Put it in the box.": "", "Don't touch this.": "", "Wait here, please.": "", "Follow me.": "", "Welcome to our plant.": "", "Please wait a moment.": "", "Would you like water?": "", "The manager is coming.": "", "Here is your badge.": "", "Thank you for calling.": "", "Your order is confirmed.": "", "Delivery is at 8 tomorrow.": "", "The dose is 10 millicuries.": "", "Here is the logbook.": "", "We follow the SOP.": "", "The license is valid.": "", "The RSO is Mr. Lee.": "", "I will send the report today.": "", "Next month we have an audit.": "", "I want to speak better English.": "", "I will practice every day.": "", "We will buy a new printer.": "", "The new target arrives in May.": ""};
